\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Frozen test splits, 150 tasks per family, three execution seeds. Baselines are the strongest single-call structure per family (direct prompting for code, chain-of-thought for math). \emph  {Vanilla} is generate$\to $verify$\to $refine with up to three iterations; \emph  {protected} is the same loop with a temperature-zero incumbent replaced only on verifier rejection. Intervals are stratified paired bootstrap 95\% CIs.}}{5}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:parti}{{1}{5}{Frozen test splits, 150 tasks per family, three execution seeds. Baselines are the strongest single-call structure per family (direct prompting for code, chain-of-thought for math). \emph {Vanilla} is generate$\to $verify$\to $refine with up to three iterations; \emph {protected} is the same loop with a temperature-zero incumbent replaced only on verifier rejection. Intervals are stratified paired bootstrap 95\% CIs}{table.1}{}}
